        "Description": "Several clients have recently complained about executions of their contracts being sloppy, lacking the clean, professional standard we are known for.\r\rAs a result, the Board has initiated the Agent Requalification Program. All active agents are required to participate in order to remain in service. Unsatisfactory performance will result in termination.\r\rBut I trust that will not be an issue for someone like you.\r\rThis exercise will focus on several of the ICA’s signature methods.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
